e board.\n\nReason: You have no pair in your hand, and your best five-card hand is Three of a Kind (Tens) with 8 and 7 as kickers — weak compared to any full house or flush. The board is dangerous (three Spades, three Tens). Checking is safe and minimizes loss. Folding is unnecessary since checking is free. There's no reason to bet or raise — you have no fold equity against a calling range, and you're likely behind. Best play is to check and see what happens.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
