cisions later. If a Queen or 10 falls, you can reassess. If a dangerous card (K, J, 9, 8, diamond) comes, you can fold on river if faced with big bet.\n\nReason: Calling is low-risk, allows you to realize equity with a decent but vulnerable hand. Raising lacks value and may backfire. Folding is too weak given investment and hand strength.\n\nAnswer: 0"}
